{
  "summary": "This experiment tested multimodal integration by adding ResNet50 image features to a strong RNA-only baseline (scvi_n200 encoder, avgpool aggregation) using concat fusion. Validation accuracy (0.632) and F1 (0.607) slightly lag behind the RNA-only baseline (0.650 accuracy, 0.628 F1), suggesting multimodal addition may not improve performance. The role of image modality and concat fusion's effectiveness remain uncertain without direct comparison to alternative fusion strategies or deeper exploration of image-RNA interactions."
}

